direction: down
title: ConcurrentLinkedQueue Lock-Free CAS Enqueue Algorithm

State: Queue Structure {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#0284C7"
  head: "head -> Sentinel Node (0x1000)"
  n1: "Node 1 (0x2000, item: 'A')"
  tail: "tail -> Node 2 (0x3000, item: 'B', next: null)"
  newNode: "New Node (0x4000, item: 'C', next: null)"
}

Step1: 1. Read Tail & Verify next == null {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#0284C7"
  desc: "Read t = tail. If t.next != null, tail is lagging; help advance it."
}

Step2: 2. CAS Link: t.casNext(null, newNode) {
  style.fill: "#06201B"
  style.stroke: "#047857"
  desc: "Atomic CAS links newNode into queue. If fails, retry loop."
}

Step3: 3. CAS Advance Tail: casTail(t, newNode) {
  style.fill: "#1E1B4B"
  style.stroke: "#8B5CF6"
  desc: "Advance tail pointer to newNode. Benign failure tolerant."
}

State -> Step1 -> Step2 -> Step3
